{"id":"negde","lemma":"негде","pos":"adj","rank":3614,"glosses":["there is no place"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/34/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Тому негде жить.","en":"Tom doesn't have any place to live.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267798","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to live"}]},{"text":"Нам негде сесть.","en":"There's no room for us to sit down.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"to sit down"}]},{"text":"Было негде купить еду.","en":"There was no place to buy food.","words":[{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to buy, to purchase"},{"g":"to go","l":"ехать"}]},{"text":"Ему было негде жить.","en":"He had no place to live.","words":[{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to live"}]},{"text":"Мне негде спать этой ночью.","en":"I have no place to sleep tonight.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to sleep"},null,{"g":"at night, by night"}]}]}